      label:
        'Kimi Code `apps/kimi-code/CHANGELOG.md`（固定到提交 `4bad441fef34a6733f5c065ddea6c1a9c1c28e50`，“chore: sync release/2026-10-21 (2.3.0) back to main (#4306)”，431,837 字节）：`## 2.3.0` 的 Patch Changes 里逐字列出 “[#4242](https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-code/pull/4242) [`c1459a6`](https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-code/commit/c1459a61845056832b85a0a220ee11a2bc5132f8) Thanks [@wbxl2000](https://github.com/wbxl2000)! - Run hooks such as `PreToolUse` and `Stop` in the session\'s project directory, as documented, instead of the directory the server was started from.”，Release `@moonshot-ai/kimi-code@2.3.0` 于 2026-10-21T05:51:43Z 发布、发布说明正文含同一条；2.3.0 与核对日期最新的 2.4.0（2026-10-28T11:45:13Z）两版都没有任何关于同一事件并发数或 `sequential` 顺序执行的条目',
