        'Qwen Code Release v0.26.3-preview.0（2026-10-27T19:08:34Z 发布，标签提交 `a2f7419d2f4327e450064907fb5ce09d52601269`，发布说明正文 872 字节）：与压缩相关的一条逐字为 “feat(core): shrink tool results to the headroom left before auto-compaction by @yiliang114 in https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/13599”；同日稳定版 v0.26.2（2026-10-27T15:32:11Z，标签提交 `402911146f6b2a80cb97423309faf1956f6defe4`）的完整变更清单里没有这一条，其压缩相关条目只有 Bug Fixes 里的 “UserPromptSubmit hook context is no longer duplicated on the next turn after automatic compaction, and compression checkpoints are protected from later rescue mutations. (#15575)”，因此该机制在核对日期只随预览通道发布',
