    'claude-permission-modes-plan': {
      label:
        'Claude Code 官方 Permission Modes 页的 “Analyze before you edit with plan mode” 一节（2026-10-28 以 `.md` 形式抓取，117,065 字节）：首段逐字为 “Plan mode tells Claude to research and propose changes without making them. Claude reads files, runs shell commands to explore, and writes a plan, but does not edit your source. Except in interactive terminal sessions with bypass permissions available, edits stay blocked until you approve the plan.”；规划期 shell 命令按 “the first of these cases that matches applies” 分三种——“**Interactive terminal sessions with bypass permissions available**: neither the classifier nor a prompt applies to planning commands.”、“**Auto mode available and the `useAutoModeDuringPlan` setting on**, which it is by default: the classifier reviews shell commands other than critical-path removals instead of prompting you. Approved commands run, and rejected ones are blocked.”、“**Auto mode not available, or `useAutoModeDuringPlan` off**: commands outside the built-in read-only set prompt for approval, including when the sandbox\'s auto-allow mode is enabled.”；进入方式逐字为 “Enter plan mode by pressing `Shift+Tab` or prefixing a single prompt with `/plan`. You can also start in plan mode from the CLI:” 加 `claude --permission-mode plan`，并写 “Press `Shift+Tab` again to leave plan mode without approving a plan.”；“Review and approve a plan” 一节写 “When the plan is ready, Claude presents it and asks how to proceed.”，三个选项为 **Yes, and use auto mode**（auto 对会话不可用时读作 **Yes, auto-accept edits**；以 bypass permissions 启动时读作 **Yes, and switch to BYPASS PERMISSIONS (no further prompts) for this session**）、**Yes, manually approve edits** 与 **No, keep planning**，并写 “Approving a plan exits plan mode and switches the session to the permission mode each approve option describes, so Claude starts editing. To plan again, cycle back to plan mode with `Shift+Tab`, or prefix your next prompt with `/plan`.”；另有 “Press `Ctrl+G` to open the proposed plan in your default text editor and edit it directly before Claude proceeds.”、`showClearContextOnPlanAccept` 开启时 “the list gains a first option that approves the plan and clears the planning context”、以及 “Accepting a plan also gives the session a generated title based on the plan, unless you\'ve already named the session.”；“Set plan mode as the default” 一节写把 `.claude/settings.json` 的 `defaultMode` 设为 `plan`，并写 VS Code 扩展发起的对话不读项目设置的起始权限模式、改在 VS Code 用户设置里写 `claudeCode.initialPermissionMode` 为 `plan`；同页 bypass 一节写 “In interactive terminal sessions with bypass permissions available, Claude Code also doesn\'t enforce plan mode\'s blocks. Claude is still instructed to plan without editing, but a file edit or shell command it attempts during planning runs without prompting. Explicit ask rules and recognized `rm` and `rmdir` critical-path removals still prompt.” 与 “Plan mode keeps its blocks wherever Claude Code runs without an interactive terminal, including non-interactive runs with `-p`, Agent SDK sessions, and conversations in the VS Code extension\'s chat panel.”；auto 模式一节写 classifier 也审查 Claude 用 `SendMessage` 发给其他 agent 的消息，“both in auto mode and in plan mode while the classifier reviews commands; the send review requires Claude Code v2.1.222 or later”；模式循环一节写 `Shift+Tab` 从 auto 起第一次切到 `default`、随后 `default` → `acceptEdits` → `plan`，可选模式排在 `plan` 之后，状态栏显示 `⏸ plan mode on`；受保护路径一节写这类路径 “are never auto-approved, except in `bypassPermissions` mode and in interactive terminal sessions in plan mode with bypass permissions available”，critical-path 删除一节写 “Removals run with no prompt only in `bypassPermissions` mode itself, not in plan mode”',
      url: 'https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permission-modes#analyze-before-you-edit-with-plan-mode',
    },
