    'codex-import-doc': {
      label:
        'Codex 官方 “Import from another agent” 页 `https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/import`（`https://developers.openai.com/codex/...` 308 重定向到 `learn.chatgpt.com`，页面提供 `.md` 孪生体，2026-11-11 核对，5,400 字节）：首段逐字为 “Use the import flow to bring instructions, settings, skills, plugins, projects, and recent work from another agent into the ChatGPT desktop app or Codex CLI. The desktop app can import from **Claude Code**, **Claude Cowork**, or **Cursor**. Codex CLI can import from **Claude Code** or **Cursor.”，并写 “Importing doesn’t change or delete your existing agent setup.”；CLI 小节逐字为 “1. Type `/import` in an idle Codex CLI session. 2. Choose **Claude Code** or **Cursor**. 3. Select the supported setup, project files, and recent chats you want to import. 4. Review the imported configuration and continue working in Codex.” 与 “Codex CLI imports up to 50 chats from the last 30 days. When connected to a local daemon or remote server, Codex looks for user settings and recent chats on that server. It also checks the current project directory, if available.”；“What ChatGPT can import” 表把 Instruction files 映射到 `AGENTS.md`、`settings.json` 映射到 `config.toml`、Skills 映射到 Skills、Plugins 映射到 Plugins、Existing project folders 映射到 Projects using the same folders、Project memories from Claude Code 映射到 Memories、Chats from the last 30 days 映射到 ChatGPT chats、MCP server configuration 映射到 Codex MCP configuration、Hooks 映射到 Codex hooks、Slash commands 映射到 Skills、Subagents 映射到 Codex subagents；“How importing works” 逐字为 “The import flow checks both your user-level setup and your existing projects. User-level setup comes from files on your machine. Project-level setup comes from files in the repositories and folders you select.”，五步为 “Detects supported setup and recent work.”、“Imports the items you select.”、“Leaves your existing agent setup unchanged.”、“Checks whether imported plugins or connections still need setup.”、“Shows a status card when you need to finish setup.”；桌面端入口是 “Open **Settings > Import**. If **Import** isn’t available as a settings section yet, open **General** and find **Import other agent setup**.”，另有 “open **Settings > Import** and turn on automatic updates to keep imported work in sync with the original agent. You can also review your import history from the same settings section.”；“What to review after importing” 逐字列出 “Tool restrictions or permissions in imported skills and agents.”、“MCP server settings that use custom authentication, headers, environment variables, or transports. You may need to sign in again.”、“Hooks whose behavior may differ after import.”、“Plugins, marketplaces, or other setup that needs manual follow-up.” 与 “Prompt templates or command-style prompts that depend on arguments, shell interpolation, or file-path placeholders.”',
      url: 'https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/import',
    },
    'codex-developer-commands-import': {
      label:
        'Codex 官方 CLI 命令参考 `https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/developer-commands`（2026-11-11 核对，`.md` 孪生体 64,320 字节，带 `?surface=cli` 查询时为 58,726 字节）：Slash 命令表第 471 行逐字为 “| [`/import`](#import-claude-code-or-cursor-setup-with-import) | Import Claude Code or Cursor setup, projects, and chats. | Migrate supported external-agent artifacts into Codex configuration and local files. |”；“### Import Claude Code or Cursor setup with `/import`” 一节逐字为 “1. Type `/import`. 2. Choose **Claude Code** or **Cursor**. 3. Select the setup, project files, or recent chats you want to migrate.” 与 “Codex looks for up to 50 chats from the last 30 days. When connected to a local daemon or remote server, Codex reads and imports files on the machine running the daemon or server. Wait until the current task finishes before starting an import.”；同页 “Command details” 列出的 `codex` 子命令为 `codex`（interactive）、`agents`、`queue`、`app-server`、`remote-control`、`app`、`debug app-server send-message-v2`、`debug models`、`debug prompt-input`、`apply`、`review`、`archive`/`unarchive`、`delete`、`cloud`、`completion`、`doctor`、`features`、`exec`、`execpolicy`、`login`、`logout`、`mcp`、`plugin`、`plugin marketplace`、`mcp-server`、`resume`、`fork`、`sandbox` 与 `update`，没有 `codex import` 或 `codex migrate`',
      url: 'https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/developer-commands?surface=cli',
    },
