    'qwen-external-memory-import-design': {
      label:
        'Qwen Code `docs/design/external-memory-import.md`（同上标签与提交，11,163 字节）：Design 段逐字为 “A versioned source set contains relative Markdown paths and UTF-8 contents. An offline parser returns source sections, stable content identities, project scope hints, references and warnings.”、“Source paths are provenance, never server destinations. Raw sessions, credentials, configuration and skills are not accepted. Only selected sections become immutable retained resources.”、“A trusted workspace owns each submitted batch.”、“Unknown, untrusted, removed, SSH and draining runtimes fail closed. The `memory_import_v1` capability advertises this contract.” 与 “Preview is deterministic and does not call a model or write memory/task records.”；落地位置逐字为 “User imports stay in the reserved `imported/` subtree of the user memory root.”，并写 “Capped user scans and index generation give native entries priority over that subtree”、“Native long links keep the capacity they had before an import; imported entries fill only remaining space.” 与 “Imports omitted from the bounded catalogue remain available through native search and explicit fetch.”；同目录中文版 `external-memory-import.zh-CN.md`（9,549 字节）写 “外部客户端需要将 Codex 知识迁移到 Qwen 原生记忆，无需安装收集器，也无需向云端运行时开放本地文件系统。” 与 “不接受原始会话、凭证、配置和技能。只有选中章节成为不可变的保留资源。”、“用户导入仍保存在用户记忆根目录的保留子树 `imported/` 中。”、“导入的项目文档使用独立私有根目录，以真实 Git common directory 为标识。”',
      url: 'https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/blob/f42fe0f3251172c1174d00382ece522eafb3c6c2/docs/design/external-memory-import.md',
    },
