    'claude-code-mode-doc': {
      label:
        'Claude Code 官方专页 “Run tool calls from code with Code Mode” `https://code.claude.com/docs/en/code-mode`（2026-11-15 首次核对，2026-11-17 以 `.md` 孪生体复核，16,977 字节，较 11-15 的 15,659 字节增加 1,318 字节）：首段逐字为 “Code Mode changes how Claude uses its tools. Without Code Mode, Claude asks for tool calls such as Bash, Read, or Edit directly and reads each result before it decides what to do next. With Code Mode, Claude writes a piece of JavaScript that makes the tool calls, and Claude Code runs that code in your session.”，NOTE 逐字为 “Code Mode is experimental and off by default. It may change or be removed in any release. To share feedback, run `/feedback`.”（末句为 11-17 新增）；示例代码用 `$` 模板串跑 `rg` 与 `npm test`、用 `edit(target, "maxAttempts: 3", "maxAttempts: 5")` 改文件，最后一行返回给 Claude；“In the conversation, you see the tool calls, such as the edit\'s diff, and not the code. To read the code, press `Ctrl+O` to open the transcript viewer. Each piece of code appears there as a collapsed **Code** row”；限制清单逐条为 Resuming（“you can resume a Code Mode session only in the terminal, with Code Mode on”）、Auto mode（分类器审代码而不是每个工具调用）、Long-running code（“you wait for it to finish, and it stops after ten minutes”）、Hooks 与 Unavailable features（“you can\'t use Remote Control, Claude in Chrome, or computer use”）、Moving the session（“you can\'t move the session to the Desktop app or turn it into a background session, and `/fork` can\'t start a background copy”）；Requirements 由 11-15 的六项加 Windows 变为八项，新增的 **Agent teams** 项逐字为 “to use Code Mode with agent teams on, you need v2.1.326 or later. Teammates run in Code Mode in the default in-process display mode, and start without it in split panes”，其余为版本 “Claude Code v2.1.323 or later, on either release channel”、账号 “a Claude subscription or Console account. You can\'t use Code Mode through a gateway, Amazon Bedrock, Claude Platform on AWS, Google Cloud\'s Agent Platform, Microsoft Foundry, or Claude Models on Google Cloud (Anthropic managed)”（末项 “Claude Models on Google Cloud (Anthropic managed)” 为 11-17 新增，此前只到 Microsoft Foundry）、组织 “your organization doesn\'t use the HIPAA configuration or zero data retention”、模型 “Claude Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5, or Fable 5.2”、Surface “an interactive `claude` session in a terminal. Code Mode doesn\'t work with `-p`, the Agent SDK, the VS Code panel, the Desktop app, or cloud sessions”、安装 “the native build of Claude Code”，Windows 另需 “Git for Windows is installed”；清单后的排除句由 “such as an API key helper, agent teams, OpenTelemetry export, or `DISABLE_TELEMETRY`” 改为逐字 “You also can\'t start Code Mode with some settings on, such as an API key helper, OpenTelemetry export, or `DISABLE_TELEMETRY`. For the fix for each, see Code Mode doesn\'t start.”，即 agent teams 已不再是「开着就起不来」的设置；开启步骤给出 `CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_CODE_MODE=1 claude`、PowerShell 写法与 `~/.claude/settings.json` 的 `env` 块，并写 “Claude Code ignores this variable in a project\'s settings files, so a repository you clone can\'t turn on Code Mode for you”，首次会话要选 “Yes, turn on Code Mode”、重启后顶部显示 “Code Mode (experimental) is on · this session can be resumed only with Code Mode on”；关闭是删掉变量或把它改成 `0`，“With a `0` in one place, Code Mode stays off even if you set `1` in the other”，组织级封禁是在 managed settings 里写 `0`、“You can\'t turn on Code Mode for your users from managed settings”，已在会话中的用户要退出或重启才生效；权限段逐字为 “Each tool call that Claude\'s code makes goes through your `deny` and `ask` permission rules and your `PreToolUse` hooks. You don\'t need to change a rule or matcher for a tool such as `Bash`.”，检查代码本身要写匹配 `REPL`（“the tool that runs Claude\'s code”）的 `PreToolUse` Hook 并读 `tool_input.code`，并新增复合命令提醒逐字为 “If you have a `PreToolUse` hook that allows or blocks shell commands, make it check each part of a command, as Bash rules do. In Code Mode, a `git push` in a folder named `app` can reach your hook as `cd \'app\' && git push`.”；长任务分 Waiting（“the code stops after ten minutes, including time you spend at permission prompts”）与 Background（“you can keep talking to Claude, and the code can run for up to two hours”，需以 auto 或 `bypassPermissions` 模式启动）；故障排查段给出不可用行 “`Code Mode (experimental) isn\'t available`”（原因同行显示、`/status` 也显示）与 13 行原因表（11-15 为 11 行），逐行为 “it isn\'t open to your account in this version” 或 “it isn\'t open to your account yet”、“it only works directly with the Anthropic API” 或 “it only works with the Anthropic API”（前半为 11-17 新增写法）、“it doesn\'t work with an API key helper”、“it only works with Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5 and later models”、“it doesn\'t work in background jobs”（处理办法由 “Start in the foreground, without `--remote-control`” 扩为再加 “If the reason shows in a teammate\'s split pane, use the in-process display mode to run teammates in Code Mode”）、“it needs settings that Claude Code downloads from Anthropic”、“OpenTelemetry is on”、“it doesn\'t yet work with the plugin”（11-17 新增行，处理办法逐字为 “In a session, run `/plugin` and disable each plugin that the reason names. If your organization turned one on, ask your administrator to turn it off”）、“it doesn\'t yet work with an installed mod”、“it can\'t be used together with agent teams yet”（处理办法由「取消 `CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS`」改为逐字 “To keep agent teams on, update Claude Code to v2.1.326 or later. To stay on your version, unset `CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS`”）、“this launch\'s tool options”（要求不带 `--restricted` 启动、把 `REPL` 加进 `--tools`、并从 `--disallowedTools` 与 `deny` 规则里去掉 `REPL`）、“couldn\'t save your answer”（要求 `~/.claude.json` 可写）与 “your organization\'s settings don\'t allow it”；另有倒计时提示逐字为 “Claude Code will automatically block this request in 1:59, to avoid holding up an unattended session”，以及 Hook 失败文案 “the hook failed”／“the hook did not finish” 与 `UserPromptSubmit` 的 `source` 为 `poll_event` 时的放行办法',
      url: 'https://code.claude.com/docs/en/code-mode',
    },
